[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20700200_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20700200_02_0010","text":"大家还能继续吧？\n下一首是这个！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20700200_02_0020","text":"────……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20700200_02_0030","text":"（啊，今天也在闪耀着呢）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20700200_02_0040","text":"（L'Antica也好，结华也好）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20700200_02_0050","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20700200_02_0060","text":"啊，制作人\n辛苦了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20700200_02_0070","text":"──嗯，辛苦了\n今天的舞台也非常棒哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20700200_02_0080","text":"啊哈，太好了\n三峰也同感！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20700200_02_0090","text":"嗯──谢谢你带来最棒的瞬间"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20700200_02_0100","text":"呵呵，这就是我们的工作嘛！"}]
